function mkdir(FS, path) {
  if (FS.analyzePath(path).exists) return;
  FS.mkdir(path);
}
```
Emscripten FS has `analyzePath`. But nested paths (e.g. `/compiler-generated/parser.pl` → dir exists) — analyzePath on a dir works.

